on_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e邀约事件·久岐忍 第一幕「帮派的日常事务」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e每日委托：\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2565\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/14/76953456/79b77eeb63503f854da4815f8e46ee89_5802259151120900374.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"众人祈祷中···\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2565/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e众人祈祷中···\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[\"bz7i1ya4s04T1758527914945\"],\"7kbygap05bgT1758527930234\":[\"sz8gyrab88T1758527943855\",\"k5ra093s9lT1758527944537\"],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"7kbygap05bgT1758527930234\",\"9yhutunrreT1758527957962\"],\"9yhutunrreT1758527957962\":[],\"bz7i1ya4s04T1758527914945\":[],\"k5ra093s9lT1758527944537\":[],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"sz8gyrab88T1758527943855\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"option\":\"【关于神樱树…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e传说中，这颗雷樱树是鸣神大人力量的化形，因此被称为「神樱树」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e「神樱树」常年花开，护稻妻永世安康。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"7kbygap05bgT1758527930234\":{\"option\":\"【关于求签…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e来神社的人们，大多想要寻求神明的庇护。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e稻妻人相信，如果求签的结果吉利，就是收到了雷神大人的祝福，接下来的日子必将顺风顺水。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果得到的结果是凶的话，则可以把签留在神社，以求逢凶化吉。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你如果有什么心愿的话，不妨也来求一签吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你好，是来参观「鸣神大社」的游客吗？来求个签吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9yhutunrreT1758527957962\":{\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e再见，祝你运势昌盛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"bz7i1ya4s04T1758527914945\":{\"option\":\"【常道恢弘…】——获得4*羁缠之花*1\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e…鸣神永恒。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没错，这就是雷神大人所追求的「永恒」的力量。看来你对稻妻已经有所了解了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这个小小的花饰就送给你吧。虽然不是神力化形的花朵，但应该也可以较为长久的陪伴着你。祝你好运。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【获得\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2321\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/05/15363053/75478596230f46e7324b17e58ec41b16_464974456051132759.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"4*羁缠之花\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2321/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2321/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/05/15363053/75478596230f46e7324b17e58ec41b16_464974456051132759.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e4*羁缠之花\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/22/288180982/b26706122e54335e75a99308e473cc62_9152838822345955871.png\"},\"k5ra093s9lT1758527944537\":{\"option\":\"【想要和亲人重逢。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e飘散再远的花瓣也将重归故土，雷神保佑你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【关于玄冬林檎…】——完成世界任务「特别的御神签」后\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦，你是说她最近变得不一样了啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e确实最近她对前来求签的人态度亲切了很多，而且也变得会耐心解答大家的问题了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e托她的福，现在来神社求签的人也变多了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"sz8gyrab88T1758527943855\":{\"option\":\"【……】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…的确有人认为愿望说出口就不作数了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e无论是什么样的愿望，祝你早日得偿所愿。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【关于大祓…】——完成世界任务「神樱大祓」后\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊…听八重大人说，你就是帮助完成了神樱大祓的那位旅者吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e真是非常感谢。大祓完成之后，神樱的繁茂更胜从前。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e神樱树根环环相连，庇佑稻妻全境。你行走在这片土地上，也会受到祝福的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1758528221","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"20","name":"NPC\u0026商店","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"NPC\u0026商店","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\"2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"展示样式\",\"attribute_key\":\"display_type\",\"value\":\"avatar\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon\",\"attribute_key\":\"icon_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"跳转链接\",\"attribute_key\":\"jump_url\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"频道icon-pc\",\"attribute_key\